<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Nyanja Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Agalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya Poolo kwa Agalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Agalatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Agal</para>
  <para style="mt">Kalata ya Poolo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt">Agalatiya</para>
  <para style="imt">Uchogolole</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalata ya Agalatiya idalembedwa ni Mtumwi Poolo munghope ya 1:1. Iyi ni kalata iyo wadalemba poolo kwa wandhu adamkhulupilila Yesu yawo adali ku mujhi wa Galatiya pakati pa chaka cha 48 ni 57 pambuyo po badwa Kilisito. Ikhozekana Agalatiya amakhala kumujhi wa Galatiya mujhi uwo umalamulidwa ni Aloma. Osoma abibiliya sajhiwa uko wadalipo poolo yapo wamalemba kalata iyi, nambho ambili aganiza kuti wadalemba yapo wadali kumujhi wa Efeso kapina kumujhi Kolitho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Poolo wadalemba kalata ino ndande ya wandhu wonjhe yawo adamkhulupilila Kilisito yawo adali kumujhi wa Galatiya yani wajha adali Ayahudi ni wajha adali osati Ayahudi. Wadalemba kalata ino ndande ya kuyachucha mayaluzo ya mthila yayo yamafuna Akilisito achate thauko la chiyahudi izo zili mu chipangano cha kale hasa yaluzo la kuchitidwa mdulidwe. Padali ni gulu la wandhu pa gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito, adajhitana Ayuda, anyiiwo adakakamiza wandhu yawo adamkhulupilila Yesu yawo adali osati Ayahudi kuti achitidwe mdulidwe. Chimchijha wandhu ameneo amafunjha mafunjho kuti yani wampacha Poolo lamulo lochita njhito imeneyo. Poolo wadateteza utumwi wake kwa kufotokozela nghani zake zina mughope ya 1:11 mbaka nghope ya 2:14 ni wadateteza Uthenga Wabwino wadafotokoza kuti uwomboli ukhoza kupezeka kwa kumkhulupilila Yesu Kilisito munghope ya 2:16. Machokelo ya chikondi cha Mnungu waulangiza kwa wandhu, ni uomboli siukhulupila vichito va wandhu.</para>
  <para style="io">Yayo yalimo mukalata iyi</para>
  <para style="io">Poolo wayamba kalata yake kwa kwaalonjela wandhu adamkhulupilila Yesu ku Galatiya munghope yo 1:1-5.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndiipo poolo wafotokozela nghani za ukhalo wake kwa pang'ono, dala wateteze kuvomelezeka kwake pa kuyaluza, ni kuchimikiza kuti wadayesa kukhala kwa kuchata thauko, nambho thauko silidamthangatile munghope ya 1:6 mbaka nghope ya 2:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambuyo wafotokozela kupunda njhito ya Thauko ni Ubwino pa uwomboli munghope ya 3 mbaka nghope ya 4.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndiipo wafotokozela maagizo yina ya pamojhi kulangiza umo ifunikila Akilisito kukhala bwino munghope ya 5 mbaka nghope ya 6:10.</para>
  <para style="io">Poolo wamalizila kalata yake kwa kuchocha moni ni pembho lothela uku ni wakumbucha kuti kung'anamulidwa ni Mnungu ni kuchitidwa mundhu wachipano ni kufunika kupunda kusiyana ni thauko ni vindhu va kubwalo ngati kuchitidwa mduludwe munghope ya 6:11-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Kalata ino ichoka kwa ine Poolo uyo nili mtumwi osati kwa ulamulilo wa wandhu, ni osati kwa mbhavu za mundhu, nambho kwa mbhavu za Yesu Kilisito ni za Mnungu Tate uyo wadamuyukicha Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Ine ni anyaabale wonjhe yao ali pamojhi ni ine tikulonjelani anyiimwe mwamkhulupilila Yesu muli ku mujhi wa Galatiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Tikufunilani ubwino ni mtendele kuchokela kwa Tate wathu ni Ambuye watu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Kilisito wadajhichocha mwene ndande ya kuchocha machimo yathu ngati umo adafunila Amnungu kuti, wakhoze kutiombola mjhiko lino lajhala voipa. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Chipano ulemelelo ukhale kwa Mnungu muyaya ni muyaya! Amina.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uthenga wabwino ni umojhipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Nizizwa kupunda ndande yandopitape ndhawi yochepa anyiimwe mwamsiya Mnungu uyo wadakutanani kwa ubwino wa Kilisito, anyiimwe mchata Uthenga wabwino wina uwo uoneka ngati Uthenga Wabwino. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Zenedi asati Uthenga Wabwino. Uzene ni kuti alipo wandhu yawo akusakalichani, wandhu yao afuna kuyapundula mayaluzo ya Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Nambho ata ngati mmojhi wanu kapina mtumiki wa kumwamba wa Amnungu wakakulalikilani Uthenga wina uwo uoneneka ngati Uthenga Wabwino kusiyana ni ujha tidakulalikilani, walesedwe mundhu mmeneyo! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ngati mujha tidakukambilani, ni saino nikambanjho, ngati mundhu waliyonjhe wakakulalikilani Uthenga wina kusiyana ni ujha mdalikidwa, walesedwe mundhu mmeneyo!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Chipano bwanji, nifuna kuvomelezedwa ni Amnungu kapina mundhu? Kapina nifuna kwakwadilicha wandhu? Ngati nidakafuna kumkondwelecha mundhu, sinidakakhala mtumiki wa Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poolo umo wadapatila utumwi wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Achaabale wanga nifuna mjhiwe kuti, Uthenga Wabwino ujha nidakulakilani siuchokela kwa wandhu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Ine sinidalandile kuchokela kwa wandhu, ni sinidayaluzidwe ni mundhu. Yesu Kilisito mwene nde uyo wanivunukulila.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Nijhiwa kuti mdathovela umo nimakhalila kale kuchatila chikalidwe cha Ayahudi yawo adamkhulupilila, niumo nidaavuticha wandhu adamkhulupilila Mnungu kwa mbhavu zambili ni kufuna kuyomwecha chikhulupi chawo. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Nane nidaakhoza anyamata anjanga ambili pa kuchatiza chikhalidwe chathu cha chiyahudi, nidajitahidi kupunda kugwila khalidwe lonjhe ilo nidalandila kuchokela kwa azee wathu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Nambho idamkondwelecha Mnungu kunisanghula ine nikali osabadwe kuti nimtumikile. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Wadanivunukilila mwana wake umo wali, dala nikhoze kulalikila Uthenga wao wa Bwino kwa wandhu yawo opande Ayahudi. Ine sinidamfunjhe mundhu waliyonjhe, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />sinidakwele kumujhi wa ku Yelusalemu kwa anyiwajha adali atumwi kabla ya ine, nambho nidapita kujhiko la Alabia ni kubwelanjho ku mujhi wa Damesiko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Yapo vidapita vyaka vitatu nidapita ku mujhi wa Yelusalemu kupezana ni Petulo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pa mkambo wa Chigiliki ikamba Kefa. Kefa ni jhina lina la Petulo</char></note>. Nidakhala kukhomo lake kwa masiku khumi ni yasano, <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />nambho sinidaone atumwi wina ingakhale Yakobo mpwake wa Ambuye Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Yaya nikulembelani, Amnungu ayajhiwa kuti sinikamba unami. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Yapo nidachoka ku mujhi wa Yelusalemu nidapita kumijhi ya Siliya ni Kilikia <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Ndhawi imeneyo, ine sinimajhiwike ni ghulu la Akilisito kujha ku jhiko la Yudea. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Anyiiwo adandovelape nghani kuti, “Mundhu yujha mmayambo wamativuticha chipano walalikila chikhulupi chimchijha icho wafuna kuchiyomwecha.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Chimwecho adamtamanda Mnungu ndande yaine.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Poolo wavomelezeka ni atumwi wina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Yapo vidapita vyaka kumi ni vinai nidapitanjho ku mujhi wa Yelusalemu pamojhi ni Banaba, chinchijha nidapita pamojhi ni Tito. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Nidapita kumeneko pakuti Mnungu wadanikambila nipite kumeneko, nidakhala nawo achogoleli kwa wokha, nidafotokozela Uthenga Wabwino ujha nilalikila kwa wandhu yawo asati Ayahudi. Nidachita chimwecho dala njhito yanga iyo nidaichita, niijha niichita saino isadakhala ilibe mate. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Adavomelezana ni ine, ata mnjanga Tito uyo wali Mgiliki, ingakhale siwadali Muyahudi siadamkakamize kuchitidwa mdulidwe, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />ata ngati kudali ni wandhu wina yao amajhichita kuti mkhulupilila Kilisito yawo adafuna wachitidwe mdulidwe. Wandhu anyiyawa adalowa kwa kuchenjela ni kufujhila ufulu wathu tilinalo pa kulunjana ni Yesu Kilisito, dala akhoze kutichita makapolo a thauko la Musa. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Sitidavomelezane nawo ata pang'ono, dala uzene wa Uthenga Wabwino uendekele kukhala pamojhi ni anyiimwe muyaya.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Nambho achogoleli achamenewo alemekezeka kupunda, adalibe chindhu chonikambila. Zenedi adalemekezeka kupunda, nambho kwanga asati kandhu ndande Mnungu asiwamkondelela mundhu. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Pambuyo pake, adajhiwa kuti Mnungu wadathonituma kualalikila Uthenga Wabwino kwa wandhu anyiyawo asati Ayahudi ngati mujha Petulo wadatumidwa kwalalikila Ayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Mnungu uyo wadamkhozecha Petulo kukhala mtumwi kwa Ayahudi, nde mmweyo uyo wanikhozecha ine kukhala mtumwi kwa wandhu asati Ayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Ndiipo Yakobo, Petulo ni Yohana anyiiawo aoneka kuti ni achogholeli wakulu, adajhiwa kuti Mnungu wadanipacha ubwino umeneo, adavomela kugwilizana niine ni Banaba. Ife tidavomelezana tikachite njhito ya wandhu asati Ayahudi, nianyiiwo apite kwa Ayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Adatipembha chindhu chimojhipe, takumbukile osauka, nanenjho nichichita chindhu chimenecho.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poolo wamnyindila Petulo ku mujhi Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Petulo yapo wadafika ku mujhi wa Antiokia ine nidamnyindila padanga ndande wadatholakwila. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Poyamba, yapo adali akali sadajhe wandhu yao adatumidwa ni Yakobo, Petulo wamatokudya ni wandhu yawo osati Ayahudi. Nambho yapo adajha wandhu ameneo, wadasiilatu kudya ni wandhu yawo osati Ayahudi, kwakuopa ghulu la wandhu yao akakamiza wandhu achitidwe mdulidwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Ayahudi wina yawo adakhulupilila adavomelezana nayo, ata Banaba nayo wadavomelezana ni ughunghuli wao. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Yapo nidaona kuti vichito vao sivilingana ni uzene wa Uthenga Wabwino, nidamkambila Petulo pachogholo pa wandhu wonjhe kuti, “Atangati iwe ni Myahudi, umo ukhalila ni wandhu wina ukhala ngati wandhu yawo osati Ayahudi, siukhala ngati Myahudi! Ukhoza bwanji kwakakamiza wandhu yawo osati Ayahudi kukhala ngati Ayahudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayahudi ni wandhu yawo osati Ayahudi aomboledwa kwa kukhulupilila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Zenedi ife ni Ayahudi ko badwa, ni asati ngati wandhu amaiko yina yayo Ayahudi ayatana ochita machimo! <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Tijhiwa uzene kuti mundhu siwakhoza kukhala wovomelezeka pachogolo pa Mnungu kwa kugwila thauko, nambho kwa kumkhulupila Yesu Kilisito. Ife Ayahudi nafe tamkhulupilila Yesu Kilisito kuti tikoze kuvomelezeka ni Mnungu kwa kupitila chikhulupi chatu kwa Kilisito, ni asati kwa kuchata thauko ndande palibe mundhu ata mmoji wakoza kuvomelezeka ni Mnungu kwa kuchata thauko. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Chipano tikafuna tivomelezedwe ni Mnungu kwa kulunjana ni Kilisito, ife sitioneke kuti niamachimo. Bwanji, chindhu ichi mate yake nikuti Kilisito watitangatila kuchita machimo? Siikhozeka ata pang'ono! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Ngati sinileke kuchata thauko dala nipate kuvomelezedwa pachogolo pa Mnungu, ndiponjho nikayamba kuchata thauko pamenepo sinikhale wamachimo. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Pakuti kwa thauko limenelo, ine namwalila, thauko lene lidanipa, nikhoze kukhala ndande ya Mnungu. Ine napachikidwa pamtanda pamojhi ni Kilisito, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />nisaino nikhala wamoyo, nambho asati inenjho, nambho ni Kilisito wakhala mkati mwanga, ukhalo uno nikhala saino nikhala kwa kukhulupilila. Kukhulupilila kwanga kuchokana ni Mwana wa Mnungu, uyo wadanikonda ni wadauchocha umoyo wake ndande yanga. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Sinifuna kuukana mwawi wa Mnungu. Ngati mundhu wachitika wovomelezeka kwa Mnungu kwa njila yochata thauko, chimwecho nyifa ya Kilisito ilibe mate!<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Kukhulupilila ni kugwila thauko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Anyiimwe Agalatiya mwakala asabobwa zene. Bwanji, yani wakulojhani? Nghani za kupachikidwa kwake Kilisito zidaikidwa padanga pachogolo panu. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Nikonda kujhiwa chindhu chimojhipe kuchoka kwanu. Bwanji, mdalandila Mzimu wa Mnungu ndande ya kuchita ngati umo lifunila thauko, kapina ndande ya kuuvela ni kuukhulupilila Uthenga wa Bwino? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Mwakhala asabobwa mtundu umeneo? Anyiimwe mdayamba kukhala moyo wa chipano kwa mthandizo wa Mzimu wa Mnungu. Bwanji, saino mfuna kumaliza kwa mbhavu zanu? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Bwanji, mavuto yaya yonjhe yadakupatani ndande ya Uthenga Wabwino yakhala yopande matepe? Zenedi siikhozeka! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Bwanji, Mnungu wakupachani Mzimu wochita vodabwicha ndande yogwila thauko, kapina ndande muuvela Uthenga Wabwino ni kuukhulupila?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Kumbukilani pa nghani za Ibulahimu, iye wadamkhulupilia Mnungu, ni kwa kukhulupilila kwake, Mnungu wadamvomela kuti iye ni wovomelezeka. <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Chipano mjhiwe kuti wandhu yawo amkhulupilila Mnungu, achamenewo nde wana azene a Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Malembo ya Mnungu yadatholangizilatu kuti Mnungu siwaachite wandhu kukhala wovomelezeka kwa kupitila khumkhulupilila Iye. Chimwecho malembo ya Mnungu yadachogholela kumkambila Ibulahimu Uthenga Wabwino uwo umakamba, “Kupitila iwe wandhu wonjhe sapachidwe mwawi.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Chipano, wajha akhulupilila apachidwa mwawi pamojhi ni Ibulahimu uyo wadakhulupilila.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Nambho wonjhe yawo akhulupilila kuomboledwa pakuchita yawo yafununika kwa thauko la Musa, achamenewo alesedwa ni Mnungu. Pakuti, Malembo ya Mnungu yakamba, “Mundhu waliyonje uyo siwachata ni kuchita yonjhe yayo yalembedwa mchikalakala cha thauko la Musa, mundhu mmeneyo walesedwa ni Mnungu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Uzene ni kuti, thauko la Musa silikhoza kumchita mundhu wakhale wovomelezeka kwa Mnungu, pakuti malembo yakamba, “Mundhu wovomelezeka kwa Mnungu siwakhale kwa kumkhulupilila Mnungu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Nambho thauko la Musa silikhulupilila chikhulupi, nambho malembo yakamba kuti, “Uyo siwakwaniliche yayo yafunika ni thauko siwakhale wamoyo.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Kilisito watiombola kuchokela mu chileso cha thauko la Musa, walesedwa ndande yathu, pakuti malembo yakamba chimwechi, “Walesedwa mundhu waliyonjhe uyo wapachikidwa pamtanda.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Chindhu ichi chichitika ndande ujha mwawi wadapachidwa Ibulahimu uwachikile wandhu wonjhe Ayahudi ni yawo asati Ayahudi kwa kupitila Yesu Kilisito, ni kwa chikhulupililo, tilandile ujha Mzimu Amnungu adakamba kuti satipache.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njhito ya Thauko ni yajha wadayakamba Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Abale wanga, sinikupacheni chifani kuchokela kuukhalo wathu wa siku zonjhe. Ganizilani umo adavomelezana wandhu awili ni kuchikiza, palibe mundhu wakhoza waongezela chindhu. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Chipano Mnungu wadamkambila Ibulahimu pamojhi ni mbadwa wake. Malembo siyakamba, “Nimibadwa yake,” yani ambili, nambho yakamaba kuti, “Nimbadwa wake,” yani mmojhi naye nde Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Icho nifuna kukamba nde ichi, Mnungu wadaika pangano chake, vyaka va mia nne ni selasini, zikali zosalembedwe thauko la Musa, ni kulichimikiza, chimwecho thauko limenelo silikhoza kuliwananga pangano limenelo, kapina kung'anamula pangano limenelo. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ngati mbhaso ya Mnungu ikhulupilila thauko, basi siikozanjho kukhulupilila icho wakamba Mnungu. Nambho Mnungu wadampacha Ibulahimu yajha wadamkambila kuti siwampache. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Chipano thauko lachiyani? Lidachuluchidwa pamenepo ndande yolangiza machimo ya wandhu, mbaka yapo siwajhe yujha wali mbadwa wa Ibulahimu uyo Mnungu wadakamba kuti siwajhe, Mnungu wadampacha Musa thauko kupitila mtumiki wa kumwamba wa Mnungu, Musa nayo wadapacha wandhu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Zenedi mthenga siwafunika, ikakhala chindhu chene cha nghani ya mundhu mmojhi, nambho Mnungu ni mmojhi, iye wadamkambila Ibulahimu popande mthenga.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umo lifunila thauko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Bwanji thauko lichuchana ni icho wadakamba Mnungu kuti siwatipache? Ata pang'ono! Pakuti ngati thauko ilo lidachochedwa lidakakhoza kwapacha wandhu umoyo, basi tidakavomelezedwa pachogolo pa Mnungu kwa kulivela thauko. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Nambho asati ndande malembo ya Mnungu yathokamba kuti, jhiko lonjhe lili panjhi pa ulamulilo wa machimo, chimwecho yawo amkhulupilila Yesu Kilisito apachidwe chijha wadakamba Mnungu kuti, siwapache kwa kumkhulupilia Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Kukhulupilila yapo kudali sikudajhe, tidamangidwa ni kulondedwa ni thauko, timalindilila kukhulupilila kumeneko kuikidwe padanga. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Thauko limenelo lidatichogoza mbaka Kilisito yapo wadajha, dala kwa kupitila kukhulupilila tichitidwe ovemelezeka pachogholo pa Mnungu. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Chipano tikhoza kukhulupilila Kilisito, chimwecho ife sitichogozedwanjho ni Thauko.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Kwa njila ya kumkhulupilila Yesu anyiimwe mwaonjhe mwakala wana Amnungu kwa kulunjhana ni Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Anyiimwe onjhe mwabatizidwa ni kulunjana ni Kilisito, chipano mwalingana ni Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Chimwecho palibe kusiyana pakati pa Myahudi ni wandhu yawo asati Ayahudi, mbowa ni mundhu ni mundhu uyo asati mbowa, wammuna ni wamkazi. Wonjhe ni chindhu chimojhi kwa kulunjana ni Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Ngati anyiimwe ni wandhu a Kilisito, basi anyiimwe ni mbadwa wa Ibulahimu, ni simlandile yajha Mnungu wadamkambila Ibulahimu kuti siwampache.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Chipano nikamba chimwechi olanja wakakhala wakali mwana, siwasiyana ni kapolo, hata ngati chuma chonjhe ni chake. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Ndhawi imeneyo wakhala panjhi pa wandhu amlela ni akumsunga mbaka yapo siijhe ndhawi ijha idaikidwa ni atate wake. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Chimwecho ni ife yapo tidali tikali wana, nafenjho chichijha tidali ngati wana tidalamuludwa vindhu va jhiko lino. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Nambho ndhawi yeneyene yapo idakwana Amnungu adamtuma Mwana wao uyo pajhiko lino la panjhi. Mwana uyo wadabadwa ni wamkazi, mwana mmeneyo wadachgozedwa ni thauko la Musa, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />waombole anyiwajha achogozedwa ni thauko, dala ife Ayahudi tichitidwe kukhala wana Amnungu.<verse eid="GAL 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Ndande chipano anyiimwe ni wanawake, Amnungu wautuma mzimu wa mwanawake mmitima mwanu, mzimu uwo utichita kuti timtane Mnungu, “Atate wathu.” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Chimwecho anyiimwe asati akapolonjho nambho niwana, ni ikakhala anyiimwe nimwana, basi simulandile yonjhe yayo Mnungu waikila wana wake.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makaikilo ya Poolo kwa Agalatiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Kale yapo simmamjhiwe Mnungu, chimwecho mmatumikila minungu iyo idali asati Mnungu wa zene. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Nambho saino pakuti mwamjhiwa Mnungu, kapina tikambe Mnungu wakujhiwani, mkhoza bwanji kubwela kutumikila thauko ni chikalidwe cha jhiko lino ni kufuna kuvitumilanjho? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Mkali kuchita pwando la siku, mwezi, nyengo ni vyaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Nikhaikila kuti ikhozekena njhito ijha nidaichita kwa anyiimwe, ikhozeka kuti yandotaika chajhe!<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Achabale nikupembhani mkhale ngati ine, simudachogozedwa ni thauko ngati ine umo nili. Yapo nidali kwanu simdanichitile choipa chilichonjhe. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Anyiimwe mjhiwa kuti utenda wanga ndeuwo udanichita nilalikile Uthenga wa Bwino kwa mala yoyamba. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ata chimwecho ndhawi ijha simdaninyoze kapina kunikana ndande ya utenda wanga, ata ngati wina adakukambilani mchite chimwecho, nambho mdanilandila ngati mtumiki wa kumwamba wa Amnungu, ngati Kilisito Yesu mwene. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Myambo mdali wandhu okondwela, ndande chipano simkondwela? Nilumbila kuti ndhawi ijha mdakakoza ata kuyazula maso yanu ni kunipacha ine. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Bwanji, saino nakhala mdani wanu ndande ya kukukambilani uzene? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Achameneo wandu wina ajhichaucha ndande yanu, nambho sakuganizilani bwino. Afuna kukupatulani ni ine kuti anyiimwe mchauchichike ndande yao. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Uzene ni chindhu chabwino kupunda kwachitila wandhu wina vindhu vabwino, mchite chimwecho masiku yonjhe ata ngati nili Patali namwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Wana wanga, ngati mujha wavutikila maye uyo wali ni pathupi ndhawi yojhimasula, niine nivutika ndande yanu mbaka ukhalo yapo siuoneke mkati Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ngati nidakakala ni anyiimwe saino, nidakakamba kwa upole pakati panu! Pakuti nikhaikila kupunda ndande ya anyiimwe!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chifani cha Ajhili ni Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nikambileni, anyiimwe mkonda kulamulidwa ni thauko, bwanji mwavela umo likambila thauko? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Yalembedwa mmalembo ya Mnungu kuti Abilahimu wadali ni wana awili, mmojhi wadabala ni wamkazi uyo wadali kapolo ni mwina wadabala kwa mkazake mfulu. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Yujha wadabala ni kapolo wadabadwa ngati umo abadwila wina, nambho yujha wadabala ni mkazake mfulu wadabadwa kuchokana ni mujha wadakambila Mnungu. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Vindhu vimenevo vidali chifani, anyamaye awili ameneo ni chifani cha mapangano yawili, loyambila nilijha lidachitika kuphili ilo litanidwa sinai, ilo Ajhili ni wanawake wadabalila ku ukapolo. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Ajhili wali ngati phili la sinai ilo lili kwa Waalabu, ni chifani cha Mujhi wa Yelusalemu cha chipano, uwo uli kuukapolo pamojhi ni wana wake. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Nambho Yelusalemu ya kumwamba ni mujhi uwo siuli kuukapolo, nawo ni chifani cha maye wathu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Pakuti yalembedwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">“Kondwela iwe wamkazi siubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">kweza mvekelo iwe siudajhimasulepo mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">pakuti wana a yujha wasiidwa niambili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">kupitilila wa yujha wali ni wammuna.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Chipano achabale wanga, anyiimwe ni wana a Mnungu kuchokana ni mujha wadakambila, ngati umo idali kwa Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Nambho ngati mujha siku zijha yujha mwana wadabadwila kwa njila iyo yazoeleledwa, wadamvutichya yujha mwana wadabadwa kwa mbhavu za Mzimu wa Mnungu, chimwecho nde umo ichitikila mbaka chipano. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Nambho malembo ya Mnungu yakamba bwanji? Yakamba chimwechi, “Mtopole wamkazi kapolo pamojhi ni mwana wake, pakuti mwana wa wamkazi kapolo siwalanjilatu pamojhi ni mwana wa wamkazi uyo osati kapolo.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Chimwecho achabale wanga, ife asati wana a wamkazi kapolo, ife ni wana wa wamkazi uyo asati kapolo.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Muusunge ufulu wanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Kilisito wadatipacha ife ufulu, iye wadafuna tikhale afulu, chipano imani nganga simdavomela kukhalanjho pajhi pa ukapolo. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Vechelani! Ine ni Poolo nikamba namwe! Ngati mkavomela kuchitidwa mdulidwe ndande ya kuvela thauko la Musa, Kilisito walibe mate yaliyonjhe muukhalo wanu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Nikambanjho padanga, waliyonjhe uyo wavomela kuchitidwa mdulidwe wafunika waligwile thauko lonjhe. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Ngati mkapenyelela kuchitidwa wovemelezeka kwa kupitila kugwila thauko, pamenepo simkale mwajhiika kutali ni Kilisito, mwausiya ubwino wa Mnungu. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Pakuti ife tilindilila kwa chikhulupilila ni kwambhavu ya Mzimu, tichitidwe wovomelezeka kwa njila ya kumkhulupilila Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Pakuti Ikakhala talunjhana ni Kilisito Yesu, kuchitidwa mdulidwe kapina kosachitidwe mdulindwe kulibe mate, cha mate kuhichita njhito kwa chikondi nde uko kulangiza kukhulupilila kwathu.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Mmayendekela bwino! Yani basi, wakuchekelezani simdauvela uzene? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Mnungu uyo wakutanani siwadakuchiticheni mchite chimwecho. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Unami pang'ono uwananga mayaluzo yonjhe ya uzene! <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Kuchokana ni kulunjana kwatu ni Ambuye, nikukhulupilila kupunda anyiimwe kuti mdali pamojhi ni ine, ni waliyonjhe uyo wakuchauchani siwalangidwe.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Achaabale wanga ngati ine nikali niyendekela kwalalikila wandhu kuchitidwa mdulidwe kwa kuchata thauko la Musa, ndande yanji chipano nivutichidwa ni Ayahudi? Ngati nimakalalikila chimwecho, kulalikila kwanga nghani za nyifa ya Yesu Kilisito pamtanda sikudakaipicha Ayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Nibwino wandhu amenewo akuchauchani paghani za kuchitidwa mduludwe adakayadula maumbidwe yawo achinawene. <verse eid="GAL 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Pakuti anyiimwe mdatanidwa ni Mnungu dala mkale afulu, ufulu wanu usidakhala ndande yochata makumbilo ya thupi, nambho mfunika mtumikilane kwa chikondi. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Pakuti thauko lonjhe likwanilichidwa kwa lamulo lino limojhi, “mkonde wa pafupi wako ngati umo ujhikondela wamwene.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Ngati mkalumana ni kutafunana ngati zinyama, mjhipenyelele msayomwechana anyiimwe kwa anyiimwe!<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuchogozedwa ni Mzimu wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Chipano nikamba chimwechi, ukhalo wanu uchogozedwe ni Mzimu wa Mnungu, mkachita chimwecho simuchatanjho makumbilo yoipa. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Pakuti makhumbolo yoipa yachuchana ni makhumbilo ya Mzimu wa Mnungu, nayo Mzimu wa Mnungu siwakhumbila vindhu voipa. Vindhu vimenevo vichuchana, ndande imeneyo simkhoza kuchita yayo mfuna. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ngati mkachogozedwa ni Mzimu wa Mnungu, basi simuchogozedwa ni thauko la Musa.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Vichito va jhiko vijhiwika navo nde ivi, uhule, chigololo, ni ukhalo woyipa, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kulambila viboliboli, ufiti, udani, ndewo, njhanje, mbwayi, chipili, mkangano ni kosavana, <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />kosakondwela mwina wakakhala ni chindhu, kulojhela mowa kudya kupunda ni vindhu vili ngati vimenevo. Nikuonyani ngati umo nidakuonyelani mmayambo, wandhu achita yameneyo saupata ufumu wa Amnungu.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Nambho ivo vichokela ukachogozedwa ni Mzimu wa Mnungu ni chikondi, kukondwela, mtendele, kulimba mtima, ubwino, kutangatila wina ni kukhulupilika, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />wojhichicha ni kujhilamula umwene. Palibe thauko ilo lichogoza kuvichucha vindhu vimenevo. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Anyiwajha ali ni Kilisito aupachika pamtanda ukhalo wao wa chijhiko pamojhi ni maganizo yake yoipa ni makumbilo yake. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Tikakhala kwa mthandizo wa Mzimu wa Mnungu, ifunika chinchijha tichate uchogolelo wake. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Basi sitidajhidama, sitadayambana kapina kuonelena njhanje.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Mlimbilane mitima ni kuthangatilana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Abale wanga ngati mkamwona mundhu fulani walakwila, basi anyiimwe mchogozedwa ni mzimu wa Mnungu muonyeni mundhu mmeneyo wasiye vichito vake, nambho mchite chimwecho kwa upole, mku ni mjhipenyelela dala mwachinawene simdalowa mmayeso. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Mthangatilane anyiimwe kwa anyiimwe kwakuchita chimwecho simkwanilichwe thauko la Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Mundhu waliyonjhe wakajhiona kuti iye ni wamate, nikumbe osati wamate wajhinyenga mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Nambho kila mundhu wajhipenyecheche mwene. Ngati ivo wavichita ni vabwino pamenepo siwakhale ni ndande ya kujhidama mkati mwake ni asati mkati mwa mnjake. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Pakuti kila mundhu siwalangidwe kuchokana ni vichito vake.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Uyo wayaluzidwa mau la Mnungu wamgwilize oyaluza wake vonjhe vabwino ivo wavipata.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Simdanyengeka, Amnungu sachitidwa chipongwe. Icho wavyala mundhu nde icho siwakolole <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Uyo wavyala mkumbilo la jhiko, siwakolole mmenemo chiwanangiko, nambho wakavyala pa chizimu wa Mnungu, siwakolole umoyo wa muyaya kuchokela kwa mzimu wa Mnungu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Chipano tidalema kuchita ubwino, pakuti ngati sitilenda sitikolele vokolola pa ndhawi yake. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Mchimwecho pakuti tili ni ndhawi, tachitile wandhu wonjhe vindhu vabwino, ni hasa achabale anjathu yawo amkhulupilila Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maonyo yothela ni moni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Penyani umo nakulembelani kwa malembo ya yakuluyakulu kwa janja langa namwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Anyiwajha afuna aoneke abwino kwa vindhu va chitupi, achaameneo nde afuna kukukakamizani anyiimwe mchitidwe mtulidwe. Achita chimwecho kwa chifukwa chimojhipe, dala achinawene sadavutichidwa ndande ya mtanda wa Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Pakuti achinawene yao achitidwa mdulidwe sagwila thauko, nambho afuna anyiimwe mchitidwe mdulidwe, dala akhoze kujhidamila mdulidwe wachitika mmathupi yanu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Nambho ine sinijhidamila chalichonjhe, nambho nijhidamila nyifa ya Yesu Kilisito pamtanda, kuchokana ni nyifa yake vindhu vonjhe va jhiko lino vilibe mate kwanga, umoyo wanga wa kale wapachikidwa niiye pamtanda. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kuchitidwa mdulidwe kapina kosachitidwe mdulidwe asati chindhu chamate, chamate ni kukhala choumbidwa cha chipano. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Niwonjhe yawo sakhulupilile, nafunila mtendele ni lisungu ni kwa wandhu a Mnungu Izilaeli.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Chipano mundhu waliyonjhe siwadanichauchanjho, pakuti pa thupi langa nili ni mawala ndande ya kumtumikila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Abale wanga, mwawi wa Ambuye wathu Yesu Kilisito ukhale nianyiime. Ikhale chimwecho.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>